.TH TCB 1
.SH NAME
tcb - Text Console Buffer
.SH VERSION
version 1.5b-1  20 Mar 2000
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fItcb\fR
.br	
\fItcb\fR [\fIdirectory\fR]
.br	
\fItcb\fR [\fIfile\fR] [<\fIfile\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fITcb\fR(1) is a file viewer that works on a text-terminal such as \fIxterm\fR(1). 
.SH FILE
.TP 3
\fI/usr/lib/tcb/HELP\fR
On-line manual file.
.TP 3
\fI/usr/lib/tcb/tcbrc\fR
Initialization file, used for setting of environment at \fItcb\fR(1) startup.  Copy \fItcbrc\fR to \fI~/.tcb/\fR directory and then edit it accordingly. (The directory \fI~/.tcb/\fR will be made at the first execution.)
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP 3
TCBCHARSET
A set of character code can be determined after \fItcb\fR(1) startup.  However, if TCBCHARSET is set, its value is used for it.  \fBascii\fP or \fBeuc-jp\fP can be set.
.SH AUTHOR
Taketo Matsubara <moody@osk.3web.ne.jp>
